  95+ 9D67 F6 04            OR 4
  96+ 9D69 32 42 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
  97+ 9D6C 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
  98+ 9D6F ED 79            OUT (C), A
  99+ 9D71 CD 9F E4         CALL AY_PlayBellChimeImpl
 100+ 9D74 3A 42 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 101+ 9D77 E6 F8            AND $F8
 102+ 9D79 32 42 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 103+ 9D7C 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 104+ 9D7F ED 79            OUT (C), A
 105+ 9D81 FB               EI
 106+ 9D82 C9               RET
 107+ 9D83
 108+ 9D83              ; --- StartTensionMusic: cuando se dispara la fase de tension, cold ---
 109+ 9D83              StartTensionMusic:
 110+ 9D83 F3               DI
 111+ 9D84 3A 42 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 112+ 9D87 E6 F8            AND $F8
 113+ 9D89 F6 04            OR 4
 114+ 9D8B 32 42 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 115+ 9D8E 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 116+ 9D91 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 117+ 9D93 CD A5 E5         CALL StartTensionMusicImpl
 118+ 9D96 3A 42 90         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
 119+ 9D99 E6 F8            AND $F8
 120+ 9D9B 32 42 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
 121+ 9D9E 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
 122+ 9DA1 ED 79            OUT (C), A
 123+ 9DA3 FB               EI
 124+ 9DA4 C9               RET
