4739+ BCDA FE 03            CP STATE_DYING
4740+ BCDC 28 20            JR Z, .kanSkip
4741+ BCDE FE 04            CP STATE_SPAWNING
4742+ BCE0 28 1C            JR Z, .kanSkip
4743+ BCE2                  ; Transicionar a STATE_DYING con puff
4744+ BCE2 DD 36 02 03      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_DYING
4745+ BCE6 DD 36 08 40      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_PUFF
4746+ BCEA DD 36 00 40      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_PUFF
4747+ BCEE DD 36 09 02      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ANIM_DELAY_PUFF
4748+ BCF2 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
4749+ BCF6 DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
4750+ BCFA DD 36 05 47      LD (IX+ENT_ATTR), WHITE | $40
4751+ BCFE              .kanSkip:
4752+ BCFE 11 10 00         LD DE, ENT_SIZE
4753+ BD01 DD 19            ADD IX, DE
4754+ BD03 C1               POP BC
4755+ BD04 10 C6            DJNZ .kanLoop
4756+ BD06 C9               RET
