4780+ BD25 28 1C            JR Z, .kamSkip
4781+ BD27 DD 36 02 03      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_DYING
4782+ BD2B DD 36 08 40      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_PUFF
4783+ BD2F DD 36 00 40      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_PUFF
4784+ BD33 DD 36 09 02      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ANIM_DELAY_PUFF
4785+ BD37 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
4786+ BD3B DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
4787+ BD3F DD 36 05 47      LD (IX+ENT_ATTR), WHITE | $40
4788+ BD43              .kamSkip:
