4809+ BD54              ; --- Colores por tipo de nasty (indexado por (SPRID - SPRID_ENEMY_0) / 4) ---
4810+ BD54              NastyColorTable:
4811+ BD54 42               DEFB RED | $40              ; Enemy 0: Spider - rojo
4812+ BD55 43               DEFB MAGENTA | $40          ; Enemy 1: Scorpion - magenta
4813+ BD56 42               DEFB RED | $40              ; Enemy 2: Bat - rojo
4814+ BD57 44               DEFB GREEN | $40            ; Enemy 3: Snake - verde
4815+ BD58 46               DEFB YELLOW | $40           ; Enemy 4: Eagle - amarillo
4816+ BD59 45               DEFB CYAN | $40             ; Enemy 5: Rat - cyan
4817+ BD5A 45               DEFB CYAN | $40             ; Enemy 6: Goat - cyan
4818+ BD5B 01               DEFB BLUE                   ; Enemy 7: RabidCat - azul oscuro
