1097+ CF7A              .roaAabbLoop:
1098+ CF7A                  ; (HL+0)=pX, (HL+1)=pY, (HL+2)=pXEnd, (HL+3)=pYEnd.
1099+ CF7A                  ; eraseRect = [eX..eX+3] × [eY..eY+3].
1100+ CF7A                  ; Overlap: pX <= eX+3 AND pXEnd >= eX AND pY <= eY+3 AND pYEnd >= eY.
1101+ CF7A                  ; eX+3 < pX -> no overlap (X)
1102+ CF7A 3A BD CF         LD A, (.roaEraseX)
