 860+ E20C                  ; W->M, Y->Bl, G->Bl (keep bright), R+->R-, C+->C-
 861+ E20C                  ;       B-  Bl-  R-  M-  G-  C-  Y-  W-   B+  Bl+  R+  M+  G+  C+  Y+  W+
 862+ E20C 00 01 02 03      DEFB    0,   1,  2,  3,  1,  5,  1,  3,   8,   9,  2, 11,  9,  5,  9, 11
