 202+ F1F2              ; --- SFX_BellChime: una campanada grave (~corta, para repetir) ---
 203+ F1F2              SFX_BellChime:
 204+ F1F2 FA DC 00 00      DEFB 250, 220, 0, 0        ; golpe grave
 205+ F1F6 50 F0 01 00      DEFB 80, 240, 1, 0         ; decay
